msgstr "Normally there is no need to change this; adjust it only when GPLlib tells you a new address."

#: includes/Settings.php:198
msgid "实际更新在「仪表盘 → 更新」或插件/主题列表中执行。"
msgstr "Run the updates themselves from Dashboard → Updates or the plugin and theme lists."

